    "text_with_media_FqXT4R": {
      "type": "text-with-media",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_mLjUza": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "GOD OF CRICKET",
            "position": "top_left"
          }
        },
        "heading_H46kJG": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "The Making of the Edition",
            "heading_tag": "h1",
            "position": "top_left",
            "highlight_effect": "default",
            "highlight_accent_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "richtext_9B4K8T": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The God of Cricket, 100 Centuries Edition is a precision crafted collectible that celebrates every milestone of Sachin’s legendary journey.<\/p><p>At the center rests an intricately designed Sachin Tendulkar 100 Centuries coin, imagined as the commemorative one hundred rupee coin India never officially minted but always deserved to.<\/p><p>Encircling this coin is a meticulously structured timeline carrying all one hundred centuries he ever scored.<\/p><p><strong>Year. Opponent. Venue type. Home or away. Exact runs.<\/strong><\/p><p>Every detail mapped with complete accuracy. What looks like art from afar transforms into pure data up close.<\/p><ul><li>A career presented visually.<\/li><li>A legacy documented in detail.<\/li><li>A tribute expressed through design.<\/li><\/ul><p>On the top of the artwork, 1989 to 2013 marks the beginning and completion of an era that redefined Indian cricket.<\/p><p><\/p>",
            "position": "bottom_left"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
