        "richtext_hjeRP8": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Born from hand-drawn drafts, this artwork was built layer by layer. The coin, The century map, The full timeline.<\/p><p>Those sketches evolved into a precise radial structure carrying Sachin Tendulkar’s complete century legacy.<\/p><p>A design built with intention and crafted with accuracy.<\/p>",
