    "faq_U7EXL8": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_fzMaty": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it a limited edition?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. As with every LEGXI collectible, this edition is strictly limited. As a tribute to Sachin Tendulkar’s total international matches, we have capped the edition at 6,640 pieces worldwide.<\/p><p><strong>Only 664 editions will ever exist.<\/strong><\/p><p>No reprints, no expansions, no restocks - once sold out, it’s gone for good. Secure your edition while it’s available.<\/p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_zn6QHg": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How Long will it take to deliver your order?",
            "answer": "<p>Your order is dispatched within 3 to 4 days, and you can expect delivery within 10 days from your order date across India. For international orders, delivery is completed within 18 days.<\/p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_MHCCNJ": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is size of the Artwork?",
            "answer": "<p>The artwork measures <strong>17 × 29 inches<\/strong> (<strong>43.18 × 73.66 cm<\/strong>), designed for a strong and refined wall presence.<\/p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_bc4eUW": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What are the print and framing specifications?",
            "answer": "<p>The artwork is produced using archival embossed printing with museum-grade stability and finished with premium gallery framing engineered for long-life display.<\/p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_gTNiAx": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is this officially associated with Sachin Tendulkar?",
            "answer": "<p>This is a LEGXI Collectible, created as a tribute to Sachin Tendulkar’s achievements. It is a non-signed, independently designed limited edition artwork, produced with respect and admiration for the legend.<\/p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_VfPxee": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How can I choose my edition number?",
            "answer": "<p>Once you place your order, the <strong>LEGXI after-sales team<\/strong> will contact you to guide you through securing your preferred edition number, subject to availability.<\/p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_M33Rjj": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can this appreciate in value?",
            "answer": "<p>Collectibles with fixed edition caps, fine craftsmanship, and strong athlete legacy often appreciate over time. While appreciation cannot be guaranteed, this edition is intentionally crafted with long-term collectible value in mind.<\/p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        },
        "question_P69VeC": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is Return Policy?",
            "answer": "<p>We accept returns and replacements only for pieces damaged in transit or manufacturing defects. Since each edition is limited and individually crafted, non-defect returns are not accepted.<\/p>",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 24,
            "mobile_icon_width": 20
          }
        }
      },
